          "short": "For example, $87.8^\\circ$, $87.9^\\circ$, $88.3^\\circ$.",
          "worked": "For example, $87.8^\\circ$, $87.9^\\circ$ and $88.3^\\circ$. Each has one decimal place and satisfies $87.5\\leq a<88.5^\\circ$.",
